  "duration_s": 426.597846,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国古代最有文人气的名亭是哪一座吗？有人说是醉翁亭欧阳修坐在那儿写出了醉翁之意不在酒，一篇记文让他名传千古。有人说是爱晚停，停车坐爱枫林晚，霜叶红于二月花杜牧，那首诗，让多少人记住了他。错。醉翁亭和爱晚亭都进不了榜首，真正排在第一的那座，从来没有一个帝王为他题字，却让天下文人心甘情愿朝他低头。今天咱们就来盘点中国古代十大最有文人气的名亭。老规矩，开讲之前，劳烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听。第十名真趣亭。在江苏苏州的狮子林里，这座亭子很有意思。他原先是元代读书人清修静坐的地方，正面三间大开间，四脚微微翘起，三面全是镂空雕花木窗。当年乾隆皇帝六次下江南，逛到狮子林坐在亭子里看假山入了迷，提笔就想写下真有趣三个字。旁边的状元心里一急赶紧凑过去，委婉劝了一句，皇上这才把有字给划掉，留下了一块真去匾额。您坐在珍瞿亭的美人靠上往外瞧。怪石就像一群大大小小的狮子在扑腾，池水清的能见底，皇权再大，架子在足到了江南。这片秀气山水面前，也得乖乖收起脾气，跟着学一学斯文。您说这算不算苏州园林骨子里的一股子？巧劲，第九名出一台当地人，也叫他钓鱼台，就在扬州瘦西湖的正中央，他四面全被湖水包着，整座亭子稳稳立在青砖砌成的高台上面。台基横跨水面，有二三十步宽。听说早年间文人们常在这儿聚会，一边喝茶吹箫，一边弹琴玩乐，连乾隆皇帝下江南也在这儿坐着甩过鱼竿。您要是挑个细雨蒙蒙的天气，走进亭子里，顺着大圆洞往外看，不远处的五亭桥和白塔正好被端端正正框在圆洞里，就像给山水套了个现成的原相框。文人造亭子，从不靠大红大金显摆有钱，而是把外面的山水借到自己眼前来。这种看似随手一摆的讲究，您说妙不妙。第八名。放鹤亭在江苏徐州的云龙山顶上，北宋元丰年间，有个不愿当官的隐士叫张天际，自己在山顶盖了这座小凉亭，地方不大，就十几平米，迎面正对着满山林海。苏轼当年被贬到徐州做官，心里苦闷，就老爱爬上山来来找他喝酒聊天，还挥笔写下了一篇放鹤亭记。您站在亭子前面，抬眼往远处看，大风吹的衣服呼呼响。整座徐州城的烟火全在脚底下，平日里为柴米油盐烦透了的心思，一下子全被吹得无影无踪。大文豪不巴结权贵，跟着白鹤一起寄托山野。这份天塌下来也压不垮的旷达，您说是不是读书人最想要的活法？第七名，丰乐亭在安徽滁州的一座山谷泉水边上。北宋庆历六年，欧阳修在滁州做官，带着人在泉水旁修了这座亭子，四周大山抱得紧紧的，旁边就是一口清泉。苏轼亲手写的丰乐亭记大石碑，到现在还立在那儿。欧阳修当年不光在这儿喝酒，作诗更常年跑到田间地头，帮老百姓琢磨收成。他给亭子起名封乐，意思就是老百姓庄稼丰收，大家伙儿天天乐呵被贬的滋味不好受，能把这滋味写成这两个字。这是功夫，也是境界第六名，沧浪亭就在苏州城南边。它是苏州现存最古老的园林，比拙政园、刘园都要老，一直能追到北宋。当年，大诗人苏舜卿在朝廷受了牵连，被罢官跑到苏州花了四万钱买下这片荒地，依水盖了。这座亭子名字取自老化水，要是清亮，我就洗洗帽带去当官水。要是浑浊，我就就洗洗脚丫子回家过日子。苏舜卿选了后者，在这喝酒写诗，硬把落魄过成了悠闲。您站在这亭子里，一面是水，一面是竹风过来竹叶的声音，细细的风。舜卿当年的那口气还留在这里，沧浪亭的文人气是把诗意写成从容，是世道浊了，我还能笑着往钱的那种活法。从第十到第六名，甄趣亭让皇上收起了霸道吹台，借圆窗，把天地框进眼里放客亭，帮苏轼吹散了心头的俗气。丰乐亭写满了老百姓的温饱，沧浪亭立下了受屈，也不弯腰的硬骨头，可他们还不是最有文人气的。接下来前五名有一座亭子，造，他的人是个落魄书生，却被历代文人奉为精神。图腾有一座亭，一场大雪，一个人一壶酒，把孤独写到了极致，可排在榜首的那座聚了四十一个文件，一场聚会，一篇文章，让他成了中国文人心理最不可替代的地方。没有帝王加持，没有庙堂背书，他凭什么排在醉翁亭和爱婉亭前面下一集已经同步更新，点开我的头像，进入主页就能看到点个关注，看看谁才是中国古代最有文人气的名亭。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00001",
      "start_ms": 310,
      "end_ms": 4590,
      "text": "您知道中国古代最有文人气的名亭是哪一座吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4950,
      "end_ms": 11710,
      "text": "有人说是醉翁亭欧阳修坐在那儿写出了醉翁之意不在酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00003",
      "start_ms": 12290,
      "end_ms": 16450,
      "text": "一篇记文让他名传千古。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00004",
      "start_ms": 16810,
      "end_ms": 18230,
      "text": "有人说是爱晚停，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00005",
      "start_ms": 18650,
      "end_ms": 20570,
      "text": "停车坐爱枫林晚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00006",
      "start_ms": 20590,
      "end_ms": 23390,
      "text": "霜叶红于二月花杜牧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00007",
      "start_ms": 23390,
      "end_ms": 23970,
      "text": "那首诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00008",
      "start_ms": 24090,
      "end_ms": 25530,
      "text": "让多少人记住了他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00009",
      "start_ms": 25770,
      "end_ms": 26010,
      "text": "错。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00010",
      "start_ms": 27010,
      "end_ms": 30780,
      "text": "醉翁亭和爱晚亭都进不了榜首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00011",
      "start_ms": 31160,
      "end_ms": 33280,
      "text": "真正排在第一的那座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00012",
      "start_ms": 33760,
      "end_ms": 36460,
      "text": "从来没有一个帝王为他题字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00013",
      "start_ms": 36900,
      "end_ms": 41060,
      "text": "却让天下文人心甘情愿朝他低头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00014",
      "start_ms": 41720,
      "end_ms": 46440,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国古代十大最有文人气的名亭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00015",
      "start_ms": 46860,
      "end_ms": 47580,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00016",
      "start_ms": 48320,
      "end_ms": 49160,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00017",
      "start_ms": 49160,
      "end_ms": 51360,
      "text": "劳烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00018",
      "start_ms": 52040,
      "end_ms": 53800,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00019",
      "start_ms": 54140,
      "end_ms": 56200,
      "text": "第十名真趣亭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00020",
      "start_ms": 57040,
      "end_ms": 59380,
      "text": "在江苏苏州的狮子林里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00021",
      "start_ms": 60160,
      "end_ms": 61645,
      "text": "这座亭子很有意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00022",
      "start_ms": 62130,
      "end_ms": 65745,
      "text": "他原先是元代读书人清修静坐的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00023",
      "start_ms": 66490,
      "end_ms": 68505,
      "text": "正面三间大开间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00024",
      "start_ms": 69310,
      "end_ms": 71125,
      "text": "四脚微微翘起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00025",
      "start_ms": 71640,
      "end_ms": 74365,
      "text": "三面全是镂空雕花木窗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00026",
      "start_ms": 74770,
      "end_ms": 77415,
      "text": "当年乾隆皇帝六次下江南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00027",
      "start_ms": 77890,
      "end_ms": 81845,
      "text": "逛到狮子林坐在亭子里看假山入了迷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00028",
      "start_ms": 82420,
      "end_ms": 85555,
      "text": "提笔就想写下真有趣三个字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00029",
      "start_ms": 85990,
      "end_ms": 89560,
      "text": "旁边的状元心里一急赶紧凑过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00030",
      "start_ms": 89600,
      "end_ms": 90835,
      "text": "委婉劝了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00031",
      "start_ms": 91610,
      "end_ms": 94035,
      "text": "皇上这才把有字给划掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00032",
      "start_ms": 94630,
      "end_ms": 96955,
      "text": "留下了一块真去匾额。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00033",
      "start_ms": 97330,
      "end_ms": 100205,
      "text": "您坐在珍瞿亭的美人靠上往外瞧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00034",
      "start_ms": 100830,
      "end_ms": 105025,
      "text": "怪石就像一群大大小小的狮子在扑腾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00035",
      "start_ms": 105770,
      "end_ms": 107995,
      "text": "池水清的能见底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00036",
      "start_ms": 108490,
      "end_ms": 109795,
      "text": "皇权再大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00037",
      "start_ms": 110370,
      "end_ms": 113300,
      "text": "架子在足到了江南。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00038",
      "start_ms": 113400,
      "end_ms": 115505,
      "text": "这片秀气山水面前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00039",
      "start_ms": 116170,
      "end_ms": 118205,
      "text": "也得乖乖收起脾气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00040",
      "start_ms": 118590,
      "end_ms": 120135,
      "text": "跟着学一学斯文。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00041",
      "start_ms": 120970,
      "end_ms": 124130,
      "text": "您说这算不算苏州园林骨子里的一股子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00042",
      "start_ms": 124130,
      "end_ms": 124674,
      "text": "巧劲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00043",
      "start_ms": 125070,
      "end_ms": 127980,
      "text": "第九名出一台当地人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00044",
      "start_ms": 127980,
      "end_ms": 129145,
      "text": "也叫他钓鱼台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00045",
      "start_ms": 129560,
      "end_ms": 131985,
      "text": "就在扬州瘦西湖的正中央，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00046",
      "start_ms": 132770,
      "end_ms": 135005,
      "text": "他四面全被湖水包着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00047",
      "start_ms": 135720,
      "end_ms": 139455,
      "text": "整座亭子稳稳立在青砖砌成的高台上面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00048",
      "start_ms": 140180,
      "end_ms": 141775,
      "text": "台基横跨水面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00049",
      "start_ms": 141990,
      "end_ms": 143425,
      "text": "有二三十步宽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00050",
      "start_ms": 143870,
      "end_ms": 146745,
      "text": "听说早年间文人们常在这儿聚会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00051",
      "start_ms": 147190,
      "end_ms": 148795,
      "text": "一边喝茶吹箫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00052",
      "start_ms": 149180,
      "end_ms": 150635,
      "text": "一边弹琴玩乐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00053",
      "start_ms": 151280,
      "end_ms": 155785,
      "text": "连乾隆皇帝下江南也在这儿坐着甩过鱼竿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00054",
      "start_ms": 156210,
      "end_ms": 158370,
      "text": "您要是挑个细雨蒙蒙的天气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00055",
      "start_ms": 158390,
      "end_ms": 159425,
      "text": "走进亭子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00056",
      "start_ms": 159750,
      "end_ms": 161385,
      "text": "顺着大圆洞往外看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00057",
      "start_ms": 161680,
      "end_ms": 166915,
      "text": "不远处的五亭桥和白塔正好被端端正正框在圆洞里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00058",
      "start_ms": 167480,
      "end_ms": 170905,
      "text": "就像给山水套了个现成的原相框。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00059",
      "start_ms": 171310,
      "end_ms": 172410,
      "text": "文人造亭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00060",
      "start_ms": 172510,
      "end_ms": 175335,
      "text": "从不靠大红大金显摆有钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00061",
      "start_ms": 175960,
      "end_ms": 179405,
      "text": "而是把外面的山水借到自己眼前来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00062",
      "start_ms": 179940,
      "end_ms": 182500,
      "text": "这种看似随手一摆的讲究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00063",
      "start_ms": 182880,
      "end_ms": 183940,
      "text": "您说妙不妙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00064",
      "start_ms": 184240,
      "end_ms": 184960,
      "text": "第八名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00065",
      "start_ms": 185360,
      "end_ms": 189500,
      "text": "放鹤亭在江苏徐州的云龙山顶上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00066",
      "start_ms": 189880,
      "end_ms": 191300,
      "text": "北宋元丰年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00067",
      "start_ms": 191740,
      "end_ms": 194240,
      "text": "有个不愿当官的隐士叫张天际，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00068",
      "start_ms": 194660,
      "end_ms": 197100,
      "text": "自己在山顶盖了这座小凉亭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00069",
      "start_ms": 197440,
      "end_ms": 198240,
      "text": "地方不大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00070",
      "start_ms": 198720,
      "end_ms": 199860,
      "text": "就十几平米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00071",
      "start_ms": 200500,
      "end_ms": 202780,
      "text": "迎面正对着满山林海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00072",
      "start_ms": 203200,
      "end_ms": 205540,
      "text": "苏轼当年被贬到徐州做官，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00073",
      "start_ms": 206320,
      "end_ms": 207460,
      "text": "心里苦闷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00074",
      "start_ms": 207880,
      "end_ms": 211010,
      "text": "就老爱爬上山来来找他喝酒聊天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00075",
      "start_ms": 211670,
      "end_ms": 214910,
      "text": "还挥笔写下了一篇放鹤亭记。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00076",
      "start_ms": 215270,
      "end_ms": 216830,
      "text": "您站在亭子前面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00077",
      "start_ms": 216850,
      "end_ms": 218090,
      "text": "抬眼往远处看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00078",
      "start_ms": 218650,
      "end_ms": 220470,
      "text": "大风吹的衣服呼呼响。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00079",
      "start_ms": 221010,
      "end_ms": 223590,
      "text": "整座徐州城的烟火全在脚底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00080",
      "start_ms": 224130,
      "end_ms": 227050,
      "text": "平日里为柴米油盐烦透了的心思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00081",
      "start_ms": 227410,
      "end_ms": 229690,
      "text": "一下子全被吹得无影无踪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00082",
      "start_ms": 230110,
      "end_ms": 232030,
      "text": "大文豪不巴结权贵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00083",
      "start_ms": 232290,
      "end_ms": 234650,
      "text": "跟着白鹤一起寄托山野。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00084",
      "start_ms": 235130,
      "end_ms": 238070,
      "text": "这份天塌下来也压不垮的旷达，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00085",
      "start_ms": 238450,
      "end_ms": 241465,
      "text": "您说是不是读书人最想要的活法？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00086",
      "start_ms": 241840,
      "end_ms": 242520,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00087",
      "start_ms": 242840,
      "end_ms": 247525,
      "text": "丰乐亭在安徽滁州的一座山谷泉水边上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00088",
      "start_ms": 248210,
      "end_ms": 249605,
      "text": "北宋庆历六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00089",
      "start_ms": 249940,
      "end_ms": 251700,
      "text": "欧阳修在滁州做官，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00090",
      "start_ms": 251920,
      "end_ms": 254565,
      "text": "带着人在泉水旁修了这座亭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00091",
      "start_ms": 255010,
      "end_ms": 256945,
      "text": "四周大山抱得紧紧的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00092",
      "start_ms": 257590,
      "end_ms": 259475,
      "text": "旁边就是一口清泉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00093",
      "start_ms": 260240,
      "end_ms": 263575,
      "text": "苏轼亲手写的丰乐亭记大石碑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00094",
      "start_ms": 264020,
      "end_ms": 265845,
      "text": "到现在还立在那儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00095",
      "start_ms": 266270,
      "end_ms": 268390,
      "text": "欧阳修当年不光在这儿喝酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00096",
      "start_ms": 268410,
      "end_ms": 271760,
      "text": "作诗更常年跑到田间地头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00097",
      "start_ms": 271780,
      "end_ms": 273605,
      "text": "帮老百姓琢磨收成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00098",
      "start_ms": 274140,
      "end_ms": 275865,
      "text": "他给亭子起名封乐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00099",
      "start_ms": 276370,
      "end_ms": 278585,
      "text": "意思就是老百姓庄稼丰收，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00100",
      "start_ms": 279000,
      "end_ms": 282505,
      "text": "大家伙儿天天乐呵被贬的滋味不好受，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00101",
      "start_ms": 283060,
      "end_ms": 285245,
      "text": "能把这滋味写成这两个字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00102",
      "start_ms": 285750,
      "end_ms": 286515,
      "text": "这是功夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00103",
      "start_ms": 286810,
      "end_ms": 288875,
      "text": "也是境界第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00104",
      "start_ms": 289330,
      "end_ms": 292285,
      "text": "沧浪亭就在苏州城南边。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00105",
      "start_ms": 293040,
      "end_ms": 295920,
      "text": "它是苏州现存最古老的园林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00106",
      "start_ms": 296520,
      "end_ms": 299400,
      "text": "比拙政园、刘园都要老，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00107",
      "start_ms": 299960,
      "end_ms": 301540,
      "text": "一直能追到北宋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00108",
      "start_ms": 302000,
      "end_ms": 302500,
      "text": "当年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00109",
      "start_ms": 302520,
      "end_ms": 305500,
      "text": "大诗人苏舜卿在朝廷受了牵连，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00110",
      "start_ms": 305980,
      "end_ms": 311180,
      "text": "被罢官跑到苏州花了四万钱买下这片荒地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00111",
      "start_ms": 311660,
      "end_ms": 312640,
      "text": "依水盖了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00112",
      "start_ms": 312640,
      "end_ms": 316360,
      "text": "这座亭子名字取自老化水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00113",
      "start_ms": 316380,
      "end_ms": 317400,
      "text": "要是清亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00114",
      "start_ms": 317880,
      "end_ms": 321000,
      "text": "我就洗洗帽带去当官水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00115",
      "start_ms": 321060,
      "end_ms": 321960,
      "text": "要是浑浊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00116",
      "start_ms": 322360,
      "end_ms": 325450,
      "text": "我就就洗洗脚丫子回家过日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00117",
      "start_ms": 326050,
      "end_ms": 327970,
      "text": "苏舜卿选了后者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00118",
      "start_ms": 328670,
      "end_ms": 330070,
      "text": "在这喝酒写诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00119",
      "start_ms": 330650,
      "end_ms": 333230,
      "text": "硬把落魄过成了悠闲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00120",
      "start_ms": 333710,
      "end_ms": 335090,
      "text": "您站在这亭子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00121",
      "start_ms": 335290,
      "end_ms": 336170,
      "text": "一面是水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00122",
      "start_ms": 336550,
      "end_ms": 340290,
      "text": "一面是竹风过来竹叶的声音，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00123",
      "start_ms": 340610,
      "end_ms": 342090,
      "text": "细细的风。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00124",
      "start_ms": 342090,
      "end_ms": 345150,
      "text": "舜卿当年的那口气还留在这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00125",
      "start_ms": 345510,
      "end_ms": 349810,
      "text": "沧浪亭的文人气是把诗意写成从容，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00126",
      "start_ms": 350370,
      "end_ms": 351670,
      "text": "是世道浊了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00127",
      "start_ms": 351670,
      "end_ms": 354345,
      "text": "我还能笑着往钱的那种活法。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00128",
      "start_ms": 354670,
      "end_ms": 356130,
      "text": "从第十到第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00129",
      "start_ms": 356410,
      "end_ms": 360040,
      "text": "甄趣亭让皇上收起了霸道吹台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00130",
      "start_ms": 360040,
      "end_ms": 360680,
      "text": "借圆窗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00131",
      "start_ms": 360820,
      "end_ms": 363520,
      "text": "把天地框进眼里放客亭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00132",
      "start_ms": 363580,
      "end_ms": 366005,
      "text": "帮苏轼吹散了心头的俗气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00133",
      "start_ms": 366550,
      "end_ms": 369005,
      "text": "丰乐亭写满了老百姓的温饱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00134",
      "start_ms": 369480,
      "end_ms": 371400,
      "text": "沧浪亭立下了受屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00135",
      "start_ms": 371400,
      "end_ms": 373025,
      "text": "也不弯腰的硬骨头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00136",
      "start_ms": 373710,
      "end_ms": 376135,
      "text": "可他们还不是最有文人气的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00137",
      "start_ms": 376540,
      "end_ms": 379385,
      "text": "接下来前五名有一座亭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00138",
      "start_ms": 379920,
      "end_ms": 380160,
      "text": "造，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00139",
      "start_ms": 380200,
      "end_ms": 382205,
      "text": "他的人是个落魄书生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00140",
      "start_ms": 382780,
      "end_ms": 385600,
      "text": "却被历代文人奉为精神。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00141",
      "start_ms": 385660,
      "end_ms": 387680,
      "text": "图腾有一座亭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00142",
      "start_ms": 387980,
      "end_ms": 389075,
      "text": "一场大雪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00143",
      "start_ms": 389450,
      "end_ms": 391055,
      "text": "一个人一壶酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00144",
      "start_ms": 391440,
      "end_ms": 393435,
      "text": "把孤独写到了极致，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00145",
      "start_ms": 393830,
      "end_ms": 397765,
      "text": "可排在榜首的那座聚了四十一个文件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00146",
      "start_ms": 398460,
      "end_ms": 399505,
      "text": "一场聚会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00147",
      "start_ms": 399840,
      "end_ms": 400865,
      "text": "一篇文章，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00148",
      "start_ms": 401270,
      "end_ms": 405295,
      "text": "让他成了中国文人心理最不可替代的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00149",
      "start_ms": 406070,
      "end_ms": 407705,
      "text": "没有帝王加持，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00150",
      "start_ms": 408280,
      "end_ms": 409775,
      "text": "没有庙堂背书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00151",
      "start_ms": 410220,
      "end_ms": 415705,
      "text": "他凭什么排在醉翁亭和爱婉亭前面下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00152",
      "start_ms": 416340,
      "end_ms": 417515,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00153",
      "start_ms": 417970,
      "end_ms": 421365,
      "text": "进入主页就能看到点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6333be0a867d3d45_s00154",
      "start_ms": 421970,
      "end_ms": 426315,
      "text": "看看谁才是中国古代最有文人气的名亭。"
    }
  ],
